      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 900,
        "content": "## Validate email deliverability via DNS MX records\n\n**Free email validation over a webhook — no paid verification service, no API key, no credentials.** Send an address, get a JSON verdict on whether its domain can actually receive mail.\n\n**Who's it for**\nPre-screening emails before they enter a funnel: sign-up / lead forms, CRM enrichment, list cleaning, cold-outreach cleanup. Core nodes only, so it runs on **n8n Cloud and self-hosted**.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Webhook takes `?email=` (GET) or a JSON body.\n2. Syntax gate: one `@` + a dotted domain, else `400`.\n3. Look up the domain's **MX records** via Google DNS-over-HTTPS.\n4. If Google times out / errors, **fall back to Cloudflare** DoH automatically.\n5. Respond `200` with `valid`, `reason`, and the resolver that answered.\n\n**Responses**\n`200 {valid:true,  reason:\"mx_records\"}`\n`200 {valid:false, reason:\"no_mx_records\"}`\n`400 {valid:false, reason:\"invalid_syntax\"}`\n\n**Setup**\nImport → open **Webhook (email in)** → copy the Production URL → **Activate**.\nCall: `GET /webhook/email-validation?email=jane@acme.com`\n\n⚠️ MX presence proves the **domain** can receive mail, not that the exact mailbox exists."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a42e0996-1ca1-4ac2-aea8-1fe8837201ee",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1072,
        1136
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 700,
        "height": 566,
        "content": "### 1 · Receive & gate on syntax\n\n**Webhook (email in)** accepts `?email=` or a JSON body. **Extract email and domain** normalises the input; **Check email syntax** requires one `@` and a dotted domain. Malformed input returns **400** and never touches DNS."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8f46c1ed-0f13-4bef-803d-120e2798cbae",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -368,
        896
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 692,
        "height": 480,
        "content": "### 2 · Primary check — Google DoH\n\nResolve the domain's **MX records** via `dns.google` (5s timeout). Answer present → **200 deliverable**; resolved but no MX → **200 no_mx_records**. On timeout / error the node's **error output** routes to the Cloudflare fallback."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "caed7f89-fcdd-4ded-b558-4e76d8327402",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -176,
        1376
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 700,
        "height": 464,
        "content": "### 3 · Automatic fallback — Cloudflare DoH\n\nRuns **only when Google fails**. Same MX lookup via `cloudflare-dns.com`, with **Response Format = JSON** so the `application/dns-json` body parses. Returns the same **200** verdicts, tagged `source: \"cloudflare\"`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
